cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KairoECS in research or operational analysis, this is unreleased metadata for the planned version, not an archived release citation. Cite the exact source commit used. Keep this file synchronized with the release note, archive note, and Zenodo draft before the first archived release."
title: "KairoECS: A Rust-first multi-method simulation engine for DES and ABM"
version: "0.4.0-alpha.1"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "KairoECS contributors"
abstract: "KairoECS is a Rust-first multi-method simulation engine treating discrete event simulation and agent-based modeling as equal paradigms, with polyglot bindings and Arrow telemetry."
keywords:
  - simulation
  - discrete-event-simulation
  - agent-based-modeling
  - rust
  - apache-arrow
license: "Apache-2.0 OR MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/edithatogo/kairos"
